{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/extras/52caa77bad74cc14dd986065384ddfa1.avif?t=1767694541\" width=1200 height=560 /></span><br>Step into a world where every shadow hides a secret! This is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure \u2014 a story-driven game that blends exploration, mystery, and puzzles into one breathtaking journey. You\u2019ll search through beautifully crafted scenes to uncover cleverly concealed items, solve intricate puzzles, and piece together the story as you go. Every discovery brings you closer to the truth\u00a0 and deeper into adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/extras/a5a7efdef9df11624c08436fe2ec7ebf.poster.avif?t=1767694541\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/extras/a5a7efdef9df11624c08436fe2ec7ebf.webm?t=1767694541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/extras/a5a7efdef9df11624c08436fe2ec7ebf.mp4?t=1767694541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Ashen Knight and his dragon reduce your homeland to embers, your fight for survival begins. Guided only by your father\u2019s crest, your mother\u2019s wisdom, and the will to stand against darkness, you awaken in the care of a stranger who knows more than they should. What starts as a quest for answers soon leads through ruined kingdoms, burning skies, and ancient secrets buried beneath stone and flame. Legends speak of a fallen order, stolen power, and the one knight who can rekindle hope \u2014 you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/extras/fc08e551247879cab3485f7a265e9f17.poster.avif?t=1767694541\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/extras/fc08e551247879cab3485f7a265e9f17.webm?t=1767694541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/extras/fc08e551247879cab3485f7a265e9f17.mp4?t=1767694541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an unforgettable mix of hidden object challenges, mind-bending puzzles, and richly detailed environments. Every scene tests your sharp eye and keen mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Embark on an epic story of betrayal, magic, and legendary beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Uncover rare relics and hidden treasures across enchanted lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Explore breathtaking hidden object scenes filled with intricate detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Battle the Ashen Knights, free captive dragons, and restore a lost Order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Solve challenging mini-games that demand both wit and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Master dozens of puzzles and brain teasers woven into your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Earn exclusive achievements as you fight to save Camelot from eternal shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise from the ashes\u2026 or be consumed by them? The fate of the realm awaits your hand \u2014 and your courage.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"SERIES OF DISCOVERIES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/72283df39d13ab6118459da536f481a0f93002a3.jpg"},{"name":"WEB OF CLUES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/928bd89d26ca8c543391a46962bea64165b155df.jpg"},{"name":"BEAM OF TRUTH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/84510396c2a9f40e1571195efa796307b34380dd.jpg"},{"name":"TRACKER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/70213a898374fbae77c8707fac7f33f5de808a09.jpg"},{"name":"COLD CALCULATION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/19a1c9ae0a698b47a3e992e0e7c7d5fc57847953.jpg"},{"name":"SEEKER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/2856740ffc46051bd294bd3923c461b4afd29cfc.jpg"},{"name":"VAULT OF KNOWLEDGE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/6cd0f2bbaf92aa59f9e644dba134c2c4edb98714.jpg"},{"name":"PINPOINT ACCURACY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/0208015d0c21bb73ff129a381dd7e539d3b5b657.jpg"},{"name":"INSTANT SOLUTION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/2cb5de8ed08c555e330a8fb148cb2c4c057d39d4.jpg"},{"name":"LIGHTNING MODE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3948140/3f48f7db069a945e423eac341c8b6e6286df6868.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948140?t=1767694541","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948140?t=1767694541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/1b21faf4b7fcd343b81c66f6d0d6cd0d14