ree captive dragons, and restore a lost Order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Solve challenging mini-games that demand both wit and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Master dozens of puzzles and brain teasers woven into your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Earn exclusive achievements as you fight to save Camelot from eternal shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise from the ashes\u2026 or be consumed by them? The fate of the realm awaits your hand \u2014 and your courage.</p>","developers":["Do Games Limited"],"dlc":[3948430],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948140/faaa43c035745b2ee9beb46593dcd1db2d1a9e93/header.jpg?t=1767694541","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948140/1545457963/3c81c7be9bbb3b4e0642a256c6845da23962f263/1762937320/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763015993","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948140/1545457963/3c81c7be9bbb3b4e0642a256c6845da23962f263/1762937320/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763015993","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948140/1545457963/3c81c7be9bbb3b4e0642a256c6845da23962f263/1762937320/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763015993","id":257183116,"name":"Chivalry